Package: spant
Type: Package
Title: MR Spectroscopy Analysis Tools
Version: 3.3.0
Date: 2025-03-27
Authors@R: c( person("Martin", "Wilson", email =
        "martin@pipegrep.co.uk", role = c("cre", "aut"), comment =
        c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2089-3956")), person("Yong", "Wang", role
        = "ctb"), person("John", "Muschelli", role = "ctb"))
Description: Tools for reading, visualising and processing Magnetic
        Resonance Spectroscopy data. The package includes methods for
        spectral fitting: Wilson (2021) <DOI:10.1002/mrm.28385> and
        spectral alignment: Wilson (2018) <DOI:10.1002/mrm.27605>.
